         recommended test: The change includes a test that exercises the review pipeline and confirms it reaches defect verdicts via separated steps.
           inputs:  Exercise the full review pipeline on a repo/task pair that reaches discrimination, with at least one mapped obligation so both enumeration and verdict stages must run. Use a client double that records every schema name and request payload, and make the pipeline’s discrimination result depend on the verdict stage so skipping or collapsing stages changes the final review outcome.
